{"resourceIdentifier":"3070","resourceName":"Liucheng County MSW Landfill Site LFG Recovery and Comprehensive Utilization Project","description":"Liucheng County MSW Landfill Site LFG Recovery and Comprehensive Utilization Project  is located at Liucheng County MSW landfill site (hereafter referred to as the Liucheng landfill site), Dabu Town, Liucheng County, Guangxi Zhuang Autonomous Region, P.R. China. The project is constructed and operated by Liuzhou City Yushan New Energy CO., Ltd.\r\nThe project started to construct on 11/08/2021.The project has a total designed capacity 1MW (2*0.5MW) and combusts the LFG, which contains nearly 50% of methane, to generate electricity and export it to the China Southern Power Grid (CSPG). Total electricity supplied to the grid in the crediting period will be 53,416 MWh. VCUs will be claimed from the methane destroyed and the grid electricity displaced. The estimated average GHG emission reductions of the project is 31,942tCO2e and the total GHG emission reductions and removals are 319,423tCO2e during the fixed 10 years crediting period.","location":{"latitude":24.633586,"longitude":109.172531},"inPublicCommentPeriod":false,"lastPublicCommentPeriod":{"startInclusive":"2022-07-26","endExclusive":"2022-08-26","endInclusive":"2022-08-25"},"attributes":[{"code":"PROJECT_ID","values":[{"type":"string","value":"3070"}]},{"code":"STATE_PROVINCE","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Guangxi Zhuang"}]}],"participationSummaries":[{"programCode":"VCS","attributes":[{"code":"PROPONENT_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Henan BCCY Environmental Energy CO.,LTD."},{"type":"string","value":"Henan, China"},{"type":"string","value":"86 371 6552 1782"},{"type":"string","value":"lwang@bccynewpower.com"}]},{"code":"PROJECT_STATUS","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Registered"}]},{"code":"EST_ANNUAL_EMISSION_REDCT","values":[{"type":"string","value":"31942"}]},{"code":"PRIMARY_PROJECT_CATEGORY_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Waste 